@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Verified claim unmanaged Zulip identity

autonumber
actor "Workspace user" as User
participant "Current external account API" as PublicAPI
participant "Private Workspace identity service" as Identity
participant "Zulip" as Zulip
database "Workspace users / provider mappings" as DB

User -> PublicAPI : connect/reconnect(HTTPS server_url, email, api_key)
PublicAPI -> Zulip : validate credential
Zulip --> PublicAPI : verified realm_uuid, user_id, delivery_email
PublicAPI -> PublicAPI : reconnect: compare all three\nwith expected linked identity
PublicAPI -> Identity : claim verified provider identity
Identity -> DB : find realm+typed user_id

alt Existing unmanaged external user
  Identity -> DB : atomically link verified owner
  note right of DB
    Messages, memberships und reactions
    Sie bleiben gleich. user UUID.
  end note
else No provider identity
  Identity -> DB : create provider mapping + link owner
else Conflicting verified owner
  Identity --> PublicAPI : fail-closed / admin resolution
end

PublicAPI --> User : current sanitized account response

note over User,DB
  Normalized delivery_email -> Workspace email Nur candidate.
  Proof = Erfolgreich validation API key against Zulip.
  api_key encrypted, write-only, never returned/logged.
  Failed reconnect validation preserves old secret,
  connection, lease and running sync unchanged.
end note

@enduml
